WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:39.780
Damn you!

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.630
In order to save Lou, who has caught the measles...

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.460
The Ideon slipped through the Heavy Mobile Mecha's attack,

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.820
and thwarted Gije's attempt to
prevent it from combining.

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:52.960
Searching a vaccine for Piper Lou,

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.370
the Solo Ship has left the Ape Planet.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:03.810
<b>Betrayal on Ajian</b>

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.860
After escaping from Gije's assault,

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:21.610
the Solo Ship has spent a week in subspace
and arrived at the colony planet Ajian.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:32.120
He's in such pain, but keeps enduring it...

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.920
It's like he's telling us to hang on too...

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.590
Please stand by after landing at gate 13!

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.470
An officer is going to board you
and perform a customs check.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:44.930
Roger.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:53.140
However, the Solo Ship crew doesn't know that
 there is a Buff Clan tracking device on their ship.

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:58.520
They mistakenly think it is a mechanism
of the Sixth Civilization.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:03.550
This tracking device can send out signals
 to nearly a million light years away,

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:06.450
where the other party is able to receive them.

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:12.370
As long as it exists, the Solo Ship cannot
 escape from the Buff Clan's pursuit.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.970
What? You want to use sub-light missiles?

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:24.030
Yes, with your permission.

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:26.720
Are you aware of the danger
involved with using them?

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:31.470
If we attempt to re-enter normal space at the speed of light...

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.770
There will be a severe burden on our fleet.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:34.600
However...

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:39.730
Not only that, once the aliens locate our territory,

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.950
they may take revenge against us with similar means.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.420
I have faith!

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:46.160
If we destroy an alien planet before their eyes,

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.410
they won't dare seek revenge.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.450
I see.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.330
I entrust this operation to you, Gije.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.660
Thank you very much.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.920
Follow the Logo Dau aliens!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.380
Enter subspace flight!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.690
I am Cobol, Vice Commander
of the Ajian Central Base.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.550
Who is in charge of this ship?

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.860
It is I, Jordan Bes, Vice Commander.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.250
This ship does not follow any military regulations.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.080
Indeed.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.990
This is an artifact of the Sixth Civilization,
and a race of aliens called the Buff Clan...

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.070
Do you have the directives
 from the Braziller Base?

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.200
Yes.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.590
Understood.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.460
If there are civilians willing to disembark, report in.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.600
After an interrogation, you're allowed to leave.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.220
Ah! We're getting off!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.260
Vice Commander.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:54.170
I am Sheryl Formossa, an assistant in the
 6th Civilization excavations on Planet Solo.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:55.930
Ah, Doctor Formossa?

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.450
No, I'm his daughter.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:58.190
Oh.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:01.880
I would like to use Ajian's large scale computer.

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:04.260
I have a copy of the research data here.

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.170
Head to the computer center.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.690
Thank you very much.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.700
She's going off on her own?

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:15.170
I'll notify you when I have the results of my research.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.000
That Sheryl...

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.920
We'll start resupplying the ship right
 away as requested, but...

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.580
All military personnel are to remain
 here and wait for further orders.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:24.550
In the Solo Ship?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.540
Of course!

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:32.700
That's why I don't like big planets,
they're full of pompous old jerks.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.600
On the other hand, you can do business
 even with fake documents.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:44.530
What is it?

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.950
There is a ship coming from the proximity of our destination!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.490
Investigate the type of the ship!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.270
Yes, sir!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:56.780
The distance is 0.03 subspace units, accelerating at 2.5.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.950
It's not one of our ships.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:03.000
I don't think it's a Sixth Civilization type either.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.550
So it belongs to the Logo Dau aliens...

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.970
All right, match our speed and course with theirs.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.560
Someone is telling us to stop!

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.810
In subspace?!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.980
It's a military ship!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:27.900
The enemy ship isn't changing its course or speed.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:31.360
Prepare to fire the main beam cannon! We'll seize them!

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:40.750
He will be okay once we use this vaccine.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.210
The fever will go away in a moment.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.300
But he's had this fever for a whole week...

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.590
It's okay, he seems to be resilient.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.510
Just have all the vaccinations reported later.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:55.010
Excuse me... Would you be able to
check the other children as well?

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.380
Yes, certainly!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.920
Something traveling at the
speed of light is approaching us!

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:11.150
What the hell is that?!

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:41.310
Vice Commander Cobol! What just happened?!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.600
I don't know! We're investigating!
Wait a little longer!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.400
Bes!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.310
Did the Buff Clan track us here?

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.940
We should have shaken them off.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.850
It hasn't been confirmed, though...

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:53.020
There was the issue with Piper Lou...

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:53.980
What is it?

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:59.340
It's not a meteor. It seems to
be some kind of missile.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.280
It looks like five or six of them hit
the opposite side of the planet.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:04.760
Bes, should we get ready for battle?

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.700
Please!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.710
This is the Congratulation!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.230
Please, let us make an emergency landing!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:11.770
We have been attacked by what seems to be an alien ship!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:14.930
It's a transport ship, let it land in gate number one!

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:15.470
Yes sir!

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:26.900
They let us in. Launch the Zigg Macks!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:27.190
Yes, sir!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.030
What's that?!

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.360
That's a Buff Clan Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.510
I have a message for
the aliens on this planet.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:43.160
We, the Buff Clan have come here
for the purpose of obtaining...

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:47.170
the Giant Machine known as Ideon 
and the spacecraft called Solo Ship!

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:52.340
If you do not hand them over, we will launch a
 second bombardment of sub-light missiles!

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:53.260
Gije!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:57.090
When that happens, ninety percent
 of your planet's population will die!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.920
That's Gije? Damn him!

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:03.840
Cosmo! Kasha! Moera! Get ready to launch!

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:07.480
Judging from the base commander's
 attitude, a battle is unavoidable!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.190
I will wait ten minutes!

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:11.150
If we have not received an answer by then,

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.440
this planet will be exterminated!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:16.460
Exterminated? He makes it sound so easy!

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:18.720
Move out our first attack squad!

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:19.590
Okay!

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:20.690
Vice-Commander Cobol!

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:22.140
What is it?

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:25.780
This Sixth Civilization material that
they're talking about, it was true!

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:27.030
All right, understood.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:31.830
Then we can also believe what they said about
 the mysterious energy on the Solo Ship.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:32.970
Commander?

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.750
We need to attack both sides.

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:37.720
We'll defend ourselves
from the sub-light missiles,

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.350
and use our remaining forces to
 strike the enemies in front of us.

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:44.270
Furthermore, our land forces will take over the Solo Ship!

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.620
Arrest Sheryl Formossa!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.390
Yes, sir!

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:51.940
You think you can fight against Ajian
with just three combat robots?!

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.050
Damn aliens!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:56.350
Five minutes left!

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.300
We're still waiting for your reply!

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.540
Sol-Amber, ready to launch!

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:15.960
Sol-Vanier is ready to go!

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.390
Sol-Conver, ready to launch!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:24.410
Joliver! Start the engine!

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:25.920
All units, wait and stay alert!

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.440
After the air force has attacked,

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.610
we'll infiltrate the Solo Ship's bridge!

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:45.990
They're going fight the Buff Clan!

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:47.530
They won't stand a chance!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:55.380
Time's up!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.800
Is fighting the only thing you're
 capable of? Hopeless fools!

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.650
You think you can pick a fight with them and win?

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.400
Sol-Amber, launching!

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.200
Sol-Vanier, launching!

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.310
Sol-Conver, launching!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:28.790
I'll take care of the Glenn Cannons.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.450
Please.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.390
This kind of attack is not enough to beat the Buff Clan!

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:00.690
You can't face the Heavy Mobile Mecha head on!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:16.080
Okay, transform into the Ideo-Delta!

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:24.170
This is how you take down a Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.640
Sol-Conver, changing!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.450
You won't beat their Heavy Mobile Mecha 
unless you fight like this!

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.530
What's happening?

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.200
I don't think it's a dry run!

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:57.200
The Buff Clan is here?!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.750
Where are you going, Sheryl Formossa?

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.460
What is this?

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:07.190
You're under arrest for leaking top secret military info!

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:08.930
You want to arrest me?!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.470
What are you saying?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.390
I'm studying the artifacts
of the Sixth Civilization...

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:13.830
Those are the secrets!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:18.060
Both the Solo Ship and Ideon are now
 under control of the Ajian military!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.230
No way...

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:26.860
They're entering the Solo Ship?

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:32.660
Shoot them down, starting from the battleships!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:35.620
I gave them a chance to talk
to us, but they ignored it!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.500
What a brutal race!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.410
We're really gonna shoot you this time!

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:57.250
This isn't a simple enemy...

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.410
Sir Gije!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.080
The aliens of this planet don't care if their
own kind get pulled into battle!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.500
I can't let these savages have the Giant! We'll take it by force!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.670
Here it is! One of the Giant Machines!

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:27.270
I missed!

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:30.050
We need to draw them out of the residential area!

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.360
Planeto!

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:55.080
It's impossible, I can't fight in the middle a city!

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:05.460
Ajian's army is firing indiscriminately!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.710
Are they serious?!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:07.760
Behind us!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:08.300
Moera?!

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.890
Watch out, we're not your enemy!

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.110
Why are they doing this?!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.590
It's the Ajian army!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:33.380
Bes! What's going on?

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:34.120
I don't know!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:34.820
Raise your hands!

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:35.360
What?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:38.040
We're taking over the Solo Ship!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.790
All of you, get off this ship!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:40.750
What'd you say?!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.970
We're the least of your worries!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:44.290
The Buff Clan is attacking...

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.330
What are you saying?

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:48.120
You are the same as the Buff Clan!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.590
Stop joking around!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:50.720
What a misunderstanding...

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.370
I'll kill you if you resist!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:55.890
To counter the aliens, you're going to dispose of us all?

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.170
Karala! Where are you going?

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:04.150
Sheryl! I was going to try
to get them to stop fighting.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.270
Don't even consider it!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:08.730
The people of this planet won't understand your idealism!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.350
They even think of me as an alien!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:17.870
Take a look! The military of this
 planet is attacking both sides.

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.070
Why?

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:22.710
Why, Sheryl?

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:27.030
If we live on different planets, we're
not all Earthlings anymore.

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:31.630
Karala, let's go back to the Solo Ship... Back to all the others.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:33.250
Sheryl.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:47.520
Let's go!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:56.320
It's your fault we Earthlings 
are fighting each other!

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.540
Kasha, raise the power!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.080
I'm gonna get rid of this thing!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:09.340
Dorawa's Zigg Mack got caught!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.000
What about the second wave of sub-light missiles?

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:12.610
Sir!

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:15.090
About one minute and twenty
seconds until they arrive!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:16.180
We're escaping!

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:18.680
This planet is going to be completely destroyed!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.060
We'll come back later to
retrieve the Giant's wreckage.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.150
Help Dorawa's Zigg Mack!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.610
Concentrate your fire on the Giant!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.110
Techno!

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.920
Fire the front Glen Cannon!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:37.700
Cosmo!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.910
The other Heavy Mobile
Mecha is running away!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:40.450
What?

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.160
What if there's a second wave?

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:45.270
Could there be a second wave
of sub-light missiles?

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.830
A second wave?! I won't let that happen!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:56.990
The left leg!

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:58.010
Leave it!

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:02.100
Damn the Giant!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.430
Deck! Behind us, to the left!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:19.360
Dorawa's Zigg Mack!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.070
Never mind! We can't help them!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:24.080
The second wave of sub-light missiles is coming!

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:29.500
We've got them!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.420
Blow them up above the satellite orbit!

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.310
Are they nuclear bombs?

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.260
No...

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:55.440
They're called sub-light missiles.

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.970
The Ajian army's staff offices have vanished!

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:01.320
It's their own fault this happened!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.860
Bes! The gauge!

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:15.100
Lou!

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:16.830
Lou! You're alright!

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:21.660
Lin!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.930
Yes, he seems to be better!

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:49.240
How many sub-light missiles are coming?

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:50.620
Seven of them.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:51.580
Oh, no.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.670
There's eight, nine, twelve of them!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.210
Twelve of them?

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.210
If they directly hit Ajian...

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.380
It'll be completely destroyed!

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:05.800
Ordinary missiles won't hit them in time!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:06.680
What can we do?

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.930
Cosmo, the button on the lower left!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:09.600
What?

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:16.310
What's this?

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.360
Look!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.160
The stomach hatch is opening!

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:24.820
What?!

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:30.160
It's aiming at those missiles!

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:40.910
What the?!

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:07.110
What was that, Cosmo?

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.290
The Solo Ship...

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:22.120
This ship, the Buff Clan, you're
all aliens to us on Ajian.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:25.670
That's why we wanted to defeat both of you.

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.500
But it doesn't matter anymore.

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:30.580
Ajian has become a wasteland.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.920
It's not completely destroyed!

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:35.560
If you return, you'll be able to live somehow.

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:39.020
That's right! But it's not that way for us.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:42.060
Regardless of where we go, we'll be
treated just like we were on Ajian!

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:46.060
From now on, we need to think twice
 before landing on an immigrant planet again.

00:21:46.060 --> 00:21:49.060
That's right. And the same goes for Earth.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:53.380
We only have two options.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:55.750
Either surrender to the Buff Clan, or keep fighting!

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:57.330
We'll keep fighting, of course!

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:02.210
With a weapon capable of making
a black hole, we're invincible!

00:22:02.900 --> 00:22:08.630
But is the infinite energy of the
Ideon really that black hole?

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:11.500
I don't believe it's only a weapon of destruction!

00:22:11.900 --> 00:22:15.520
Still, it's a power we need if we want to stay alive!

00:22:15.990 --> 00:22:16.990
Ms. Sheryl!

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:19.940
Please analyze the Sixth Civilization's
 language as soon as possible.

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:20.940
We're counting on you.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:21.810
Huh?

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:23.320
Yes...

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:30.650
The Solo Ship has gained a new power.

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:37.950
However, no one knows whether it was
really given to them by the Ide or not.

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:43.740
The Solo Ship can only set off on
yet another wandering journey.

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:55.180
<i>Under attack by Harulu's underling Gamus,</i>

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:57.840
<i>the Solo Ship takes refuge on a new planet.</i>

00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:03.530
<i>Disregarding Karala's request for peace, 
Gamus orders a special strike.</i>

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:08.730
<i>A new type of Heavy Mobile Mecha threatens
 the Ideon with its ramming attack!</i>

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:15.190
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon:
"Gamus' Special Orders."</i>

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:17.700
<b>Gamus' Special Orders</b>

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:17.100
<i><i>Space Runaway!</i></i>

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:35.720
tatta hitotsu no hoshi ni suterare

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:35.720
<i>I've been abandoned merely by one world</i>

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:43.060
owarinai tabi kimi to ayumu to

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:43.060
<i>As I walk this endless journey together with you</i>

00:23:43.350 --> 00:23:48.610
itsukushimi futo wakeatte

00:23:43.350 --> 00:23:48.610
<i>We unexpectedly share our affection</i>

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:55.990
kizu wo nameau douke shibai

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:55.990
<i>Feeling sympathy for each other in this farcical play</i>

00:23:56.330 --> 00:24:02.080
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:23:56.330 --> 00:24:02.080
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:08.670
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:08.670
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:14.640
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:14.640
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:15.340 --> 00:24:22.020
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:15.340 --> 00:24:22.020
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>
